[00:00.00]Against the Tide (逆潮) - 鸣潮先约电台/Forts/Obadiah Brown-Beach
[00:01.35]   
[00:01.35]出品：鸣潮先约电台
[00:02.08]   
[00:02.08]词：Obadiah Brown-Beach
[00:02.49]   
[00:02.49]曲：Obadiah Brown-Beach
[00:02.89]   
[00:02.89]编曲：Obadiah Brown-Beach
[00:03.37]   
[00:03.37]吉他：Obadiah Brown-Beach
[00:03.85]   
[00:03.85]混音/母带：Hexany Audio
[00:04.50]   
[00:04.50]监制：Grass/Steven Tang
[00:04.99]   
[00:04.99]As whispers ride the wind in my ears
[00:09.89]低语在耳边锈成风	
[00:09.89]Dusk has brought the dawn of my fears
[00:14.67]黄昏捎来恐惧的破晓	
[00:14.67]The gale devoured the heavens and the light
[00:19.83]风潮蚀尽天穹与日光	
[00:19.83]Enshrined in shadow a tomb built of night
[00:25.21]囚于阴翳之中 一座无垠黑夜构就的冢	
[00:25.21]Strike my blade in rhythm with the storm
[00:29.57]让剑与风在掌心交响	
[00:29.57]Entwined by fate summon the ashen swarm
[00:34.78]任由命运席卷 我依旧唤起万钧灰烬	
[00:34.78]If freedom must be wrought by waves
[00:39.64]若自由必需穿过波涛	
[00:39.64]Let this crown melt to dust and be carried away
[00:44.35]就把这顶冠冕熔作尘埃 向彼岸吹拂而去	
[00:44.35]So let the gale become one with me
[00:49.46]任风潮重塑这副躯壳	
[00:49.46]Follow me the dawn will rise
[00:54.39]随我迈向将临的曙光	
[00:54.39]As they kneel before their deity
[00:59.82]当人们跪拜神像	
[00:59.82]I will fight to turn the tide
[01:06.01]我正逆风而上 力挽狂澜	
[01:06.01]And rage against the night
[01:08.20]抵挡黑夜的降临	
[01:08.20]The air enfolds around me
[01:12.96]狂风在我周遭环绕	
[01:12.96](in a tempest rife with light)
[01:14.65]（在光芒万顷的风暴之中）	
[01:14.65]I'll go and I'll open up the skies
[01:19.72]而我负意前行 撕裂天穹	
[01:19.72](to rage against the night)
[01:21.40]（抵挡黑夜的降临）	
[01:21.40]As the gale grows I bellow a fervent battle cry
[01:27.12]风潮愈烈 而我高唱炽热的战歌	
[01:27.12]I'll find our way out right through the eye
[01:32.68]我将找到出路 穿越那	
[01:32.68]The eye of the storm
[01:35.11]风暴之眼	
[01:35.11]My gaze affixed on the stars trapped above
[01:41.04]用目光眺望被囚禁的星辰	
[01:41.04]Their light as faint as the prayers I bear with love
[01:47.68]其微光孱弱 正如我以爱怀揣的祈愿一般	
[01:47.68]When the shadows of the past find their grave
[01:54.10]当往昔的阴霾沉入土壤	
[01:54.10]And the echoes of our souls sink 'neath the waves
[02:00.60]当灵魂的回响沉入深海	
[02:00.60]I will stand resolute at the edge with you
[02:05.82]我会与你坚韧并肩于世界尽头	
[02:05.82]Against the dying of the light
[02:08.12]阻止光芒的消逝	
[02:08.12]The air enfolds around me
[02:13.09]狂风在我周遭环绕	
[02:13.09](as a tempest filled with light)
[02:14.53]（在倾注光芒的风暴之中）	
[02:14.53]I'll go and open up the skies
[02:20.05]而我负意前行 撕裂天穹	
[02:20.05](and rage against the night)
[02:21.37]（抵挡黑夜的降临）	
[02:21.37]As the gale grows I bellow a fervent battle cry
[02:27.02]风暴愈烈 而我高唱炽热的战歌	
[02:27.02]I'll find our way out of the storm
[02:32.21]我们将冲破风暴	
[02:32.21]We'll go straight through the eye
[02:38.78]穿越那风暴之眼	
[02:38.78]I will stand
[02:43.74]我会伫立	
[02:43.74]And I will wait
[02:48.66]我会等待	
[02:48.66]At the edge
[02:54.36]在世界的尽头	
[02:54.36]I will wait
[02:59.09]我会等待	
[02:59.09]As the day wains
[03:03.71]任时光消逝	
[03:03.71]At the edge
[03:08.53]在世界的尽头	
[03:08.53]An iris blooms
[03:14.03]等鸢尾绽放	
[03:14.03]So let the gale become one with me
[03:19.31]任风潮重塑这副躯壳	
[03:19.31]Follow me the dawn will rise
[03:24.33]随我迈向将临的曙光	
[03:24.33]As they kneel before their deity
[03:29.19]当人们跪拜神像	
[03:29.19]I will fight to turn the tide
[03:36.50]我正逆风而上 力挽狂澜	
[03:36.50]The air enfolds around me
[03:42.40]狂风在我周遭环绕	
[03:42.40](in a tempest filled with light)
[03:43.79]（在倾注光芒的风暴之中）	
[03:43.79]I'll go and open up the skies
[03:48.90]而我负意前行 撕裂天穹	
[03:48.90](and rage against the night)
[03:50.40]（抵挡黑夜的降临）	
[03:50.40]As the gale grows we know the storm we will defy
[03:56.19]风潮愈烈 我们已决意抗争到底	
[03:56.19]We'll find our way out
[03:58.84]我们会找到出路	
[03:58.84](I'll find our way out)
[04:02.28]我会找到出路	
[04:02.28]Right into the eye
[04:05.33]穿越风暴之眼	
[04:05.33]Defy the storm
[04:10.19]无惧风暴	
[04:10.19]Our world reforms
[04:15.12]让世界重塑	
[04:15.12]At the world's edge
[04:20.06]在世界尽头	
